{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00314",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 3.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.54,
      "end_seconds": 7.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.66,
      "end_seconds": 12.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "It's a very painful, swollen big toe, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.78,
      "end_seconds": 15.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.19,
      "end_seconds": 19.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Right, it's been about a week, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.33,
      "end_seconds": 24.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.83,
      "end_seconds": 27.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.22,
      "end_seconds": 39.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.46,
      "end_seconds": 42.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.76,
      "end_seconds": 45.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Any rash or chills at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.86,
      "end_seconds": 49.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.56,
      "end_seconds": 54.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Okay, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.62,
      "end_seconds": 56.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.64,
      "end_seconds": 61.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.6,
      "end_seconds": 63.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.04,
      "end_seconds": 77.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.84,
      "end_seconds": 80.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.67,
      "end_seconds": 98.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.68,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.45,
      "end_seconds": 102.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Um, thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.64,
      "end_seconds": 104.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.39,
      "end_seconds": 107.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.01,
      "end_seconds": 111.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Right, has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.31,
      "end_seconds": 126.12,
      "duration_seconds": 13.81,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.6,
      "end_seconds": 140.12,
      "duration_seconds": 12.52,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.94,
      "end_seconds": 145.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Good, um, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.9,
      "end_seconds": 151.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.31,
      "end_seconds": 155.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.82,
      "end_seconds": 176.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "The big toe joint is red, hot, swollen and extremely tender to touch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.07,
      "end_seconds": 187.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with an acute gout flare at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.93,
      "end_seconds": 194.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Right, you know, I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.93,
      "end_seconds": 215.25,
      "duration_seconds": 19.32,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an acute gout flare, and we'll know more once the a uric acid level is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a very painful, swollen big toe for about a week, severe, and no rash or chills."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.94,
      "end_seconds": 218.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Yes, you know, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.79,
      "end_seconds": 224.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.93,
      "end_seconds": 238.94,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "Um, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.47,
      "end_seconds": 251.87,
      "duration_seconds": 11.4,
      "text": "I'm going to order a uric acid level, for suspected gout. Let's use naproxen, 500 milligrams, twice a day after food, for five days. That's for gout flare."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.43,
      "end_seconds": 253.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.73,
      "end_seconds": 272.62,
      "duration_seconds": 17.89,
      "text": "Cut right back on red meat, organ meats, beer and sugary drinks, and drink plenty of water. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Keep an eye out, and if the joint gets hotter or you develop a fever, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.28,
      "end_seconds": 275.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "I mean, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.26,
      "end_seconds": 279.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Please come and see me in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.99,
      "end_seconds": 283.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Okay, um, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.87,
      "end_seconds": 291.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.92,
      "end_seconds": 303.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "So, I take the naproxen, 500 milligrams, twice a day after food and come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.64,
      "end_seconds": 312.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.78,
      "end_seconds": 316.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}